Z||000006||MinnGreenGT||11-30-2001||01:08 PM||||Well Stang... glad to see you finally coming around  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I would recommend passing on the '84 if possible.  There were a ton of changes made to the 85 that make it much easier to restore.  Just watch the local classifieds and mall section here for cheap deals.  If you can pick up a rough 85SE or similiar for $500 you'd have a good start at least.  <P>Don't worry, no grudges here... you can ask whatever you want/need to and you'll get civil answers (at least from some of us).<P>------------------<BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif"> ||||reg||1
