Z||000009||Fierowrecker||11-30-2001||06:22 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by BlackStang95:<BR><B>In the va area that they want to get rid of consider donating it to me for gradual restoration.  Working on cars is fun   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Where's the rusty 84 coupe's at? </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hey BS95!<BR>You would become BF84?<BR>As to your search, look for a good frame/body with a blown motor/tranny...<BR>It is far easier to replace the engine/trans combo than to repair hidden rust damage to the space frame...<BR>I picked up a "parts car" for $200 that was in need of an engine, and after $700, I have a sweet ride...<BR><P>------------------<BR>crash... The Fierowrecker<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://fiero.nl/uploads/crash_sig.jpg">        <IMG SRC="http://fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif"> ||||reg||1
